# Review routing. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a pull
# request touches; the branch protection on main requires one of them to approve.
# Owners are the four maintainers in CONTRIBUTORS.md, by GitHub login, so keep the
# two in step. GitHub ignores an owner without write access to the repository,
# so each login needs it.

# Everything, unless a line below is more specific
*                                   @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws

# The two runtime layers and the contract between them
/src/socialagent/                   @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws
/packages/socialagent-runtime/      @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws

# Infrastructure: IAM, networking, data stores
/infra-terraform/                   @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws

# The admin console has its own stability bar
/socialagent-admin-console/         @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws

# CI and release machinery
/.github/                           @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws

# Security-sensitive documents need a maintainer who reviewed the threat model
/docs/threat-model.md               @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws
/docs/data-flows.md                 @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws
/SECURITY.md                        @emolvera @digalaviz @art-aws @mfls-aws
